and sell copies, subject to attribution.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. HARDWARE & ENGINEERING SCHEMATICS (/hardware)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive (CERN-OHL-P).
You may redistribute and modify these schematics, 3D designs, and manufacturing files 
under the terms of the CERN-OHL-P, provided appropriate attribution is given to 
SARL B.A. LAB.

